Subject: [PATCH 106/168] cpufreq: andes-cpufreq: Andes processors PowerBrake
 driver support (#190)

Reviewed-on: https://gitea.andestech.com/RD-SW/linux/pulls/190
Reviewed-by: Ben Zong-You Xie <ben717@andestech.com>
Reviewed-by: Tim Shih-Ting OuYang <tim609@andestech.com>
